  "prefLabel": "Env-A 625.07 Emission Limitation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 625.07 Emission Limitation. In lieu of Env-A 625.05 or Env-A 625.06, the owner or operator of a stationary source shall be in compliance with this part if actual emissions without controls in each calendar year period do not exceed any of the following limits:\n\n(a) 25 tons of VOCs:\n\n(b) 5 tons of any individual HAP; and\n\n(c) 12.5 tons of combined HAPs.\n\nSource. #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a600.html"
